1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,119
This tutorial covers facilities and
parking in Oasis Crest

2
00:00:03,119 --> 00:00:05,892
Properties: what can be booked, how a
Tenant

3
00:00:05,892 --> 00:00:08,665
asks for it, and how a manager approves.

4
00:00:08,665 --> 00:00:11,091
Signed in as the Company Admin, open

5
00:00:11,091 --> 00:00:13,171
the Oasis Crest Residence Tower property.

6
00:00:13,171 --> 00:00:15,944
The Amenities tab lists the Residents
Fitness Centre:

7
00:00:15,944 --> 00:00:18,370
bookable, active, and open to every tower.

8
00:00:18,370 --> 00:00:21,836
The Parking tab lists spot B2-18 on level
B2, available.

9
00:00:21,836 --> 00:00:24,609
Now sign in as the Tenant Ahmed Hassan.

10
00:00:24,609 --> 00:00:27,382
From the home page, open Facilities and
Parking.

11
00:00:27,382 --> 00:00:30,848
Select Request on the fitness centre, pick
a preferred date

12
00:00:30,848 --> 00:00:34,314
and add a note with the time, then Submit
Request.

13
00:00:34,314 --> 00:00:36,740
The card now shows one pending request;

14
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:39,166
nothing is booked until a manager
approves.

15
00:00:39,166 --> 00:00:41,592
Request parking spot B2-18 the same way,

16
00:00:41,592 --> 00:00:44,019
with a note about the second car.

17
00:00:44,019 --> 00:00:47,138
Both are listed under My Requests as
Pending, and

18
00:00:47,138 --> 00:00:49,911
either can still be withdrawn with Cancel
Request.

19
00:00:49,911 --> 00:00:52,337
Back as the Company Admin, open
Operations,

20
00:00:52,337 --> 00:00:54,417
Bookings, where both requests are waiting.

21
00:00:54,417 --> 00:00:56,150
Open the fitness centre request.

22
00:00:56,150 --> 00:00:59,616
The drawer shows the Tenant, the unit, the
preferred date

23
00:00:59,616 --> 00:01:02,735
and the note, and the other requests for
the

24
00:01:02,735 --> 00:01:05,854
same facility, so a clash is visible
before deciding.

25
00:01:05,854 --> 00:01:08,974
Add a note to the Tenant and select
Approve.

26
00:01:08,974 --> 00:01:12,093
Then open the parking request and approve
it too;

27
00:01:12,093 --> 00:01:15,213
an approved spot can be released from here
later.

28
00:01:15,213 --> 00:01:17,639
Back as the Tenant, My Requests shows

29
00:01:17,639 --> 00:01:20,065
both as Approved, with the manager's
notes.

30
00:01:20,065 --> 00:01:23,185
When the second car goes, Release Spot
hands the

31
00:01:23,185 --> 00:01:26,304
parking spot back, so another Tenant can
request it.
